    <sys:String x:Key="se.idle">Idle detection</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="se.idleDesc">Off by default. When on, leaving your desk pauses the countdown</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="se.idlePrinciple">How it works</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="se.idlePrincipleBody">It only reads the system timestamp of your last keyboard/mouse input. No input for the set duration counts as being away, both countdowns pause, and coming back settles the time you were gone. To avoid false positives while watching videos it ignores you when audio is playing or a fullscreen app is in front; locking the screen counts immediately. No keystroke content is ever recorded.</sys:String>
